    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">1. Heavy-Duty Air-Bubble Wrap (80-GSM):</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">This layer protects your valuable items from minor scratches and bumps during transportation. The 80-GSM (grams per square meter) heavy-duty air-bubble wrap ensures extra cushioning for your possessions and minimizes potential damages.</p>
