    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">2. High-Density Edge Guards:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">To safeguard the corners and edges of your furniture and delicate items, high-density edge guards are used as a secondary layer of protection. These guards absorb any sudden impacts and reduce the risk of chipping or breaking.</p>
